**Title**: Whispering Waves: Oliver's Coastal Journey

**Description**: Drift into a serene slumber with the tranquil tale of Oliver, an eleven-year-old boy who embodies patience and acceptance, as he wanders the enchanting expanse of a coastal shoreline. Accompanied by Tilly, a wise and gentle turtle, Oliver embarks on an introspective journey amid the soothing embrace of twilight. As they explore the sandy shores and rocky coves, the rhythmic whispers of the ocean and the soft calls of nature weave a tapestry designed to lull you into restful sleep, easing anxiety and nurturing emotional calm. This sleep-friendly narrative invites you to surrender to the gentle flow of life, finding peace in the timeless dance of the tides.

